*.png binary
*.jpg binary
# Append-only log: every task branch appends at the end, so plain merges always
# conflicted there. git's built-in union driver keeps both sides' lines instead.
# Safe only because DECISIONS.md is append-only (PROCESS.md): an in-place edit of
# the same line on both sides would keep both versions with no conflict marker.
# Do not add files that are edited in place (STATUS.md, BACKLOG.md, QUESTIONS.md).
DECISIONS.md merge=union
